{
  "$comment": [
    "The families of the unit suite (docs/adr/0013-run-a-targeted-pull-request-ci-and-the-heavy-jobs-before-a-release.md,",
    "docs/adr/0016-run-every-job-on-every-pull-request.md), read by .github/scripts/ci-families-check.sh, which fails",
    "ci.yml when a project under src/ belongs to no family here, or to two, or a project of the unit suite to none, and",
    "hands ci.yml's unit matrix the families. coverage-modules.sh reads the projects, RuntimeClosingTests the projects of",
    "its own family, which tests/UnitTests.props embeds; codecov.yml's flags are generated from them",
    "(ci-families-check.sh --codecov-flags).",
    "families.<name>.tests: its project of the unit suite, tests/<tests>/<tests>.csproj, which a job of its own builds",
    "and tests. One per family, and every project of the suite is one family's.",
    "families.<name>.projects: the projects under src/, by folder name. Each is in exactly one family, whose project",
    "of the unit suite tests it, and whose RuntimeClosingTests reads the IL of each but those no application loads."
  ],
